{"id": "B17BC8B0-4991-4AD9-8E3E-8A55AC705948", "title": "Suzuki-Kupplung: 4-Methoxybiphenyl", "summary": "Ansatz im 10-mmol-Maßstab, Katalysatortest", "stages": [{"id": "43A816A1-02F1-4EFE-BF1A-DA229B462876", "title": "Stufe 1 – Kreuzkupplung", "sourceURL": "doi:10.1021/cr00039a007", "summary": "Palladium-katalysierte Suzuki-Kupplung von $\\ce{4-MeOC6H4Br}$ mit $\\ce{PhB(OH)2}$ zu 4-Methoxybiphenyl.", "procedure": "4-Bromanisol (1.87 g, 10.0 mmol), Phenylboronsäure (1.46 g, 12.0 mmol) und $\\ce{K2CO3}$ (2.76 g, 20.0 mmol) wurden in Toluol (40 mL) und Wasser (10 mL) vorgelegt und 15 min mit Argon entgast. Nach Zugabe von $\\ce{Pd(PPh3)4}$ (347 mg, 3 mol%) wurde 16 h bei $80\\,^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$ gerührt.", "observation": "Die gelbe Suspension färbte sich nach ca. 1 h dunkelbraun. DC (Hexan/EtOAc 9:1): $R_f = 0.45$. Farblose Kristalle nach Umkristallisation aus Ethanol.", "chemicals": [{"id": "B8C1B31D-F717-40E1-82AF-2F194C5A6BFF", "name": "4-Bromanisol", "equivalents": "1", "cas": "104-92-7", "molarMass": "187.04", "density": "1.494", "amount": "0.01", "volume": "1.252", "mass": "1.87"}, {"id": "DEF9B290-39BA-44F1-A557-9F26990CE63F", "name": "Phenylboronsäure", "equivalents": "1.2", "cas": "98-80-6", "molarMass": "121.93", "density": "", "amount": "0.012", "volume": "", "mass": "1.463"}, {"id": "DE02F9DC-3841-4305-B155-8CBC1F25C66F", "name": "Pd(PPh₃)₄", "equivalents": "0.03", "cas": "14221-01-3", "molarMass": "1155.56", "density": "", "amount": "0.0003", "volume": "", "mass": "0.347"}, {"id": "1B760EAC-53AB-4AA7-A045-803CC161B080", "name": "K₂CO₃", "equivalents": "2", "cas": "584-08-7", "molarMass": "138.21", "density": "", "amount": "0.02", "volume": "", "mass": "2.764"}, {"id": "83D40B82-D025-4F80-867C-E0FBC2C2F8A3", "name": "Toluol", "equivalents": "", "cas": "108-88-3", "molarMass": "92.14", "density": "0.8668", "amount": "", "volume": "40", "mass": ""}, {"id": "35417E8C-0D16-44EC-A82E-C45F4F55371F", "name": "Wasser", "equivalents": "", "cas": "7732-18-5", "mola